                donating their time, so the music you hear all day is money that
                stays with the park.{" "}
                {hasSchedule ? (
                  <>
                    They are listed here in the order they play; the{" "}
                    <a href="#pf-schedule">schedule</a> has the same sets laid
                    out stage by stage.
                  </>
                ) : (
                  <>
                    Set times go up as soon as we have them, so follow us on{" "}
                    <a href={FACEBOOK_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                      Facebook
                    </a>{" "}
                    if you don't want to miss your favorites.
                  </>
                )}
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pf-lineup-list">
              {LINEUP.map((performer, i) => (
                <article
